#==============================================================================================
#
#   transition_event - CSS::TransitionEvent: transitionrun, transitionstart, transitionend and
#                      transitioncancel
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/CSS/TransitionEvent.cpp (lines 1-42) with the inline members
#       of TransitionEvent.h, by region p4a: an Event carrying the transitioned property's
#       name, the elapsed time and the pseudo-element. The prototype
#       (WEB_SET_PROTOTYPE_FOR_INTERFACE) waits for the bindings (phase 3).
